# External Wisp Server for Netlify, The first one the client connects to is used
# WISP_URL, if set, is used on its own. Otherwise WISP_PREFERRED is tried first, then WISP_FALLBACK.
# Within a list, the first server that connects wins.
# If all three are empty, the built-in defaults in src/build.js are used
# (wss://wisp.mercurywork.shop/, then wss://wispbyte.com/ and wss://anura.pro/wisp/).
WISP_URL=
WISP_PREFERRED=
WISP_FALLBACK=
